timeline_submission_research_project.pdf

To train a BiLSTM model to compare with baseline LSTM to predict future ridership trends across 12 distinct public transit services (Komuter, Komuter Utara, Komuter   
Terbau, ETS, Intercity, Monorail, RapidBus Penang, RapidBus KL, MRT Putrajaya (less data), MRT Kajang, LRT Kelana Jaya, LRT Ampang) using GTFS static data, fuel price,  
GADM administrative boundaries, population density, rainfall, OSM points of interest, ridership, school & public holiday, and walking friction. Evaluate using 100% -    
(MAE% + RMSE% + MAPE%) as model accuracy and R2 metric.